{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_02",
  "title": "叛乱前哨",
  "storyCode": "TW-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "904460a4f3f28888922931ff7f94c1bde48b752c3e1bb73acb453c229cd1edd6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 2上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "3:59 P.M.    天气/多云\n移动城镇沃伦姆德，感染者居住区，十二音街道"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "亚叶姐姐......你在生气吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "他们的态度意味着什么，我太清楚了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "但是，但是安托不会有事的，她比我们任何人都熟悉莱塔尼亚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "嗯！安托姐姐一定没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "但愿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "总觉得这附近有点安静得可怕......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "嗯，跟紧点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "看上去不光有普通的居民，还有很多感染者，不过这不是重点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "刚才阻止那些暴徒的时候我就在想了，这个街道的规模，怎么看都只是普通的街区吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "只是把感染者们集中起来生活，并没有什么明面上的差别对待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "但实际上，感染者依旧被约束了人身自由，而且除了那些能够“物尽其用”的感染者，大部分人这辈子和坐牢没什么区别......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "只不过牢狱变成了一条街道，多了几十倍的狱友罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "看这儿，这家面包店多久没有开过门了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "啊......我好像看到源石虫爬过去了......好不卫生啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "店门口的灰尘和落叶都没人打扫，这个社区没有在正常运作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "虽说是在特殊时期，但街上见不到一个买卖面包的人？公共交通也停摆了，这也太不自然了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "因为，因为之前的事情？店主被吓走了之类的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "但至少他们还有活着的权利，他们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "亚叶姐姐......！声音小点！嘘！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......我没有在指责他们，我只是说......关于“武装感染者”的话题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "他们会是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "那个宪兵提到了“萨卡兹”，这是首先要确定的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "如果真的和我们所知道的“感染者武装组织”有关，我们必须警觉起来。这里的情况也许比那个宪兵说的还要复杂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "是这样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "如果感染者的情况够好，那只是因为处境还不够绝望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "他们肯定还有事情瞒着我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "亚叶姐姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "不用那么紧张喔，安托姐姐可是很聪明的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "从刚才开始，亚叶姐姐就一直是很可怕的状态嘛。没关系的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "只要我们好好努力，就能出色地解决这件事，就像各位干员前辈那样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "所以稍微放轻松一点吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......哈，我又被小丽萨安慰了？这是怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "嘿嘿，烦恼不分大小啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "二位，请稍等——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "是你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我记得我说过我们不需要帮助，只需要权限就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "抱歉，虽然亚叶小姐那么说了，但是毕竟情况特殊，二位人生地不熟的，如果出了什么意外，我们无法承担。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "......亚叶姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "好吧......如果有本地人在身边，也许这里的居民也不会这么害怕我们了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "没错！咳咳！十二音街道原本是沃伦姆德最大的感染者聚集区......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "不过现在因为某些原因，这里也是抗议者最多的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "所以亚叶小姐，现在打算怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "其实我并不是很建议深入这里......不过如果您想了解沃伦姆德的现状，这的确是个好选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......先四处逛逛吧，没必要操之过急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "如果你愿意说点关于安托医生的事情，我会很高兴的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "亚叶小姐......真的很关心安托医生呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "她是我的同学，是我为数不多的好友，更是罗德岛不可或缺的成员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "......是吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "啊，请往这边走，这里是通往秋千广场的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "安托在这里做了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "啊......医治这里的感染者，帮助那些被感染的人做心理辅导。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "因为天灾信使的失误，沃伦姆德镇没能在大裂谷出现前及时避开，遭到了不小的损失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "安托医生有机会离开这里，但是她选择了留下。沃伦姆德停泊在现在的位置之后，她建立起了临时医疗据点，为了更好地安置感染者们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "安托医生她......被当做这里感染者们的英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......这是她应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "嗯，没错，比起死板的学习，她果然更适合实践。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......呵呵，是啊，真好，我都能想象到她一脸得意的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "亚叶小姐，这是您造访沃伦姆德后第一次笑容呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "今天的亚叶姐姐大部分时间都很吓人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "欸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "前面......前面有好多人，这附近的人都聚集在这里了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......不用管？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "只是聚在一起的话，也不能成为逮捕他们的理由吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "他们看过来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "怎么突然就安静下来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "......不，情况不太对......他们在听谁说话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "站在他们身后的，站在人群最后的那个——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "是个，萨卡兹吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "萨卡兹......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "text": "亚叶姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "text": "我知道！有人冲过来了！喂，你，注意保护好自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "text": "是、是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
